x8649 text "A token is the unit a model reads and writes, so fewer tokens means less to read, write and pay for. Counts use the o200k tokenizer on the source of the same test programs. Dense is the same A0 program in a shorter surface form that converts losslessly to the canonical form; both are plotted."
x8650 puts x8648 x8649
x8651 call close x8650 
ret x8651
end

